+## godot-box3d (EGP native scene adapter)
+
+The opt-in native scene physics adapter in `modules/box3d/scene_backend` is adapted
+from [godot-box3d](https://github.com/bearlikelion/godot-box3d), revision
+`dd7964f7091d8c74fb21fdd47d6a536eccbcc20f`, MIT, Mark Arneman 2026. Its original
+license and source provenance are retained beside the modified files. It shares
+the pinned Box3D solver; it does not vendor another solver or godot-cpp runtime.
+
+## LiteNetLib (EGP managed networking)
+
+- Upstream: https://github.com/RevenantX/LiteNetLib
+- Version: 2.1.4, commit ddacf9b7a3e821cc052e90c30daf82f0702a6db4
+- License: MIT (LICENSE.txt retained)
+- All library C# sources compile into EGP.Networking. See litenetlib/EGP-UPSTREAM.md.
+
+## LiteEntitySystem (EGP managed replication)
+
+- Upstream: https://github.com/RevenantX/LiteEntitySystem
+- Version: 1.2.2, commit d7448a8ac1353259a6feb07c9612d4bfc733f329
+- License: Apache-2.0 (LICENSE and NOTICE retained)
+- Library C# sources, RefMagic IL/runtime and SyncVar analyzer are retained.
+- EGP tick/rollback hooks and decoder/lifecycle fixes are documented in liteentitysystem/EGP-UPSTREAM.md.
